{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"分裂域"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"分裂域"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>若"},{"Local":{"url":"域扩张","text":"域扩张"}},{"Plain":"类比于覆叠, 那么分裂域则是覆叠的局部平凡化. 这里的局部是指通过"},{"Local":{"url":"Grothendieck拓扑","text":"覆盖"}},{"Plain":" (更具体地说是"},{"Local":{"url":"平展景","text":"平展覆盖"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<p>对于域 $k$ 上的多项式 $f$, 域扩张 $k\\subset K$ 分裂 $f$, 等价于如下条件: 拉回\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n{ccc}\r\n&amp;&amp;\\operatorname{Spec}k[x]/(f)\\\\\r\n&amp;&amp;\\downarrow\\\\\r\n\\operatorname{Spec}K &amp; \\to &amp; \\operatorname{Spec}k\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n是若干个 $\\operatorname{Spec}K$ 的无交并.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It was this observation that led Grothendieck to think that the neighborhoods $U$ in topological spaces could effectively be replaced by maps $C \\to X$ which are not necessarily monic.</p>\n<p>— Saunders Mac Lane, Ieke Moerdijk "},{"Local":{"url":"MaclaneMoerdijkSGL","text":"SGL"}},{"Plain":" III.1 节</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>域 $k$ 上一族多项式 $S\\subset k[x]$ 的<strong>分裂域</strong>是满足如下条件的"},{"Local":{"url":"域扩张","text":"域扩张"}},{"Plain":" $k\\subset K$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$S$ 中的每个多项式在 $K$ 上分裂为一次多项式的乘积;</li>\n<li>$K$ 中包含 $k$ 以及 $S$ 中的多项式的所有根的最小的子域是 $K$ 自身.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>自同构</h3>\n<p>一个可分多项式 $f\\in k[x]$ 的分裂域 $K$ 的自同构 $\\operatorname{Aut}_k(K)$ 的阶数恰为 $f$ 的次数.</p>\n"}]}}